  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: 50 LINES
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: 'Bet Per Line: 1'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES_1
    value: LINES
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_0
    value: WILD
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: Appears on 2, 3, 4 and 5 reels and substitutes for all symbols except        .
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_12
    value: SCATTER
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_12
    value: 3 Scatters on reels 1, 3 and 5 triggers <style=coinColor>Magnificent Ocean
      Free Games!</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_TITLE_1
    value: DIVING ADVENTURE
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: "- Base Game consists of 3 levels. Each level has a different symbol set
      with different\n   values and features.\n- Each spin, player goes down along
      the progression bar and uses oxygen        .     \n- Oxygen can be obtained
      from Oxygen symbol on reels.\n- The current amount of oxygen is shown on           (beware
      red zone).\n- Once oxygen runs out, the adventure ends.\n- Each denomination
      consists of Base Bet and Extra Bet and the below % indicates\n   the % of Extra
      Bet to the Base Bet:\n     Denomination 1: 10% with chance to win up to 3 oxygen
      per oxygen symbol   \n     Denomination 2: 20% with chance to win up to 4 oxygen
      per oxygen symbol   \n     Denomination 3: 50% with chance to win up to 5 oxygen
      per oxygen symbol"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_TITLE_2
    value: DIVING ADVENTURE
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: "- There is a special feature point along the progression bar.\n- Once
      player reaches this point, one of the features will be randomly triggered.\n-
      List of features:\n     LVL 1 \u2013 Random Wild Feature, Wild With Multipliers
      Feature\n     LVL 2 \u2013 Random Wild Reel Feature, Sticky Wilds Feature, <style=coinColor>Ancient
      Treasures Bonus!</style>\n     LVL 3 \u2013 Re-spin with Sticky Wilds, Re-spin
      with explosion wilds, <style=coinColor>Ancient Treasures\n                 Bonus!</style>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_TITLE_3
    value: ANCIENT TREASURES BONUS
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: "- There are 23 objects to pick from to win 5 possible Sets of Treasures\n
      \  and one special Wheel Set to win.\n- Player can win the Treasure Set that
      will be completed first.\n- Before completing a Treasure Set, if Wheel Set is
      completed, then\n   it triggers <style=coinColor>Wheel of Prizes</style> and
      allows players to win one more Treasure\n   Set."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_TITLE_4
    value: MAGNIFICENT OCEAN FREE GAMES
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_4
    value: '- During Free Games, Random Wild Reel Feature is triggered every spin.

      - No Progression during Free Games.

      - No oxygen is consumed during Free Games.'
